1
00:00:00,913 --> 00:00:04,043
(Sheldon:)Uh, I enjoy some French
toast with butter and syrup.

2
00:00:04,049 --> 00:00:07,079
(Sheldon:)Uh, then a wormhole opens,

3
00:00:07,085 --> 00:00:10,685
(Sheldon:)and whisks me millions of years

4
00:00:10,689 --> 00:00:13,289
(Sheldon:)into the future where
my towering intellect

5
00:00:13,292 --> 00:00:16,692
(Sheldon:)is used to save the last
remnants of mankind

6
00:00:16,695 --> 00:00:19,125
(Sheldon:)from a predatory alien race.

7
00:00:21,033 --> 00:00:23,563
(Penny:)Interesting,
you didn't mention Amy.

8
00:00:24,870 --> 00:00:28,240
(Sheldon:)Who do you think made the French
toast with butter and syrup?

9
00:00:29,541 --> 00:00:30,971
(Woman in lab coat:)You're about to enter the lab

10
00:00:30,976 --> 00:00:33,376
(Woman in lab coat:)of the late Dr. David Saltzberg.

11
00:00:33,378 --> 00:00:35,308
(Woman in lab coat:)While conducting studies
on slowing

12
00:00:35,314 --> 00:00:38,144
(Woman in lab coat:)the aging process, there was
a catastrophic accident

13
00:00:38,150 --> 00:00:39,850
(Woman in lab coat:)and he died.

14
00:00:41,053 --> 00:00:43,383
(Woman in lab coat:)Or did he?

15
00:00:43,388 --> 00:00:45,718
(Leonard:)Ladies?

16
00:00:45,724 --> 00:00:47,324
(Emily:)Are you being polite or scared?

17
00:00:48,527 --> 00:00:50,497
(Penny:)Yup.

18
00:00:52,798 --> 00:00:55,198
(Emily:)Ah, what a room!

19
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:57,270
Oh-oh!
Oh!

20
00:00:59,438 --> 00:01:00,968
(Leonard:)This is cool.

